== diags.diag/input-fails-shorthand
BYN1031 11:4 `T!E` is an input form; write `T f() fails E`
  label the input form
  help write `fails ParseError` as the last clause of the signature
  fix 11:4-11:31  parse(string s) fails ParseError
BYN1031 16:4 `T!E` is an input form; write `T f() fails E`
  label the input form
  help write `fails ParseError, RangeError` as the last clause of the signature
  fix 16:4-16:50  parseSmall(string s) fails ParseError, RangeError
